    "title": "Translate- Language Translator",
    "description": "<b>Translate: all language app is the best translator for speech-to-text translation in any language.</b>\r\n\r\nTranslate all language translator app will help you to communicate with foreigners in their native language and abroad students. If you go to a foreign country and you can\u2019t understand their language then this translator app is helpful for you to translate all text and voice. Translate Language Translator app can translate more than 100 languages by using this free translation app.\r\n\r\nQuick translator: Guru translate app\r\nTranslate all language: free language translator app is the best application for students for scanning documents. The phrase dictionary is also helpful for understanding things according to the origin of words or definition of words with synonyms & antonyms. Translate Language Translator: Text Translator app provides multi-languages translation like German to English translation/English to Hindi Translator/Spanish to Japanese translation/South Korea to English translation/French and Portuguese translation and many more are translatable.\r\n\r\nTranslate Language Translator & Translation app provides the facility to share your translated word or sentences with others, sharing from the share button option or you can listen from speak button and copy on the clipboard.\r\n\r\nAll language translator app is helpful to understand and learn a new language without taking any classes. Language Translator free app have the feature of voice translator into text provides the facility of quick translation. You just speak and the translator translates all your speaking words into the selected language. \r\n\r\n<b>Highlights of Translate Language Translator App:</b>\r\nTranslate language app easily translate words and sentences translation.\r\nLanguage translator app help for speak and translate with a voice translator.\r\nfree language translator app facilitates listening to your translated text.\r\nAll language translator app provides the facility of share or copy and paste your translated text.\r\nfree translate language & voice translator app provides the word\u2019s synonyms and antonyms after searching your word in 100 languages.\r\nLanguage translator app & translate language free simply take an image or text document and translate it into your desired language.\r\nTranslate all language & Translation app provides the detail in history feature.\r\nLanguage translate app has a simple and attractive user interface.\r\nSay hi translate chat translator app for chat conversation with multi-language.\r\n\r\n\r\nTranslate Language app & All language translator free also supports the following languages:\r\nAfrikaans, Albanian, Arham, Arabic (\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629), Bosnian, Bengali (\u09ac\u09be\u0982\u09b2\u09be), Bulgarian (\u0411\u044a\u043b\u0433\u0430\u0440\u0441\u043a\u0438), Catalan (Catal\u00e0), Chinese Simplified (\u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587), Chinese Traditional (\u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587), Czech (\u010ce\u0161tina), Danish (Dansk), Dutch (Nederlands), English, Filipino, French (Fran\u00e7ais), German (Deutsch), Greek (\u0395\u03bb\u03bb\u03b7\u03bd\u03b9\u03ba\u03ac), Hebrew (\u05e2\u05d1\u05e8\u05d9\u05ea), Hindi (\u0939\u093f\u0902\u0926\u0940), Hungarian (Magyar), Icelandic (\u00cdslenska), Indonesian (Indonesia), Italian (Italiano), Japanese (\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e), Korean (\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4), Lao, Latvian (Latvie\u0161u), Lithuanian (Lietuvi\u0173), Malay (Melayu), Norwegian (Norsk), Persian (\u0641\u0627\u0631\u0633\u06cc), Polish (Polski), Portuguese (Portugu\u00eas), Romanian (Rom\u00e2n\u0103), Russian (\u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439), Slovak (Sloven\u010dina), Spanish (Espa\u00f1ol), Swedish (Svenska), Tajik, Tamil (\u0ba4\u0bae\u0bbf\u0bb4\u0bcd), Telugu (\u0c24\u0c46\u0c32\u0c41\u0c17\u0c41), Thai (\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22), Turkish (T\u00fcrk\u00e7e), Ukrainian (\u0423\u043a\u0440\u0430\u0457\u043d\u0441\u044c\u043a\u0430), Urdu (\u0627\u0631\u062f\u0648), Vietnamese (Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t), Yoruba, Zulu.\r\n\r\nTranslate All language translator app provides the \u201cPhrases\u201d feature and the phrase have 15 further features that are discussed in our daily life like:\r\nCommon expressions\r\nAccommodations\r\nTravel & Directions\r\nEmergency\r\nMoney\r\nLocation\r\nGreetings\r\nWork\r\nTime & Dates\r\nCommunication\r\nShopping\r\nWeather\r\nMaking Friends\r\nEntertainment\r\nPhone",
